msgstr "セキュリティプラグイン"

#: src/Admin/SetupWizard.php:201
msgid ""
"Detected and coexisted with: this plugin adds no CSP header, uses only "
"standard login hooks, and keeps its REST routes reachable where a plugin "
"locks the REST API down to logged-in users."
msgstr ""
"検出し、共存しています。本プラグインは CSP ヘッダーを追加せず、標準のログイン"
