"Passkeys sit alongside passwords by default: nothing is taken away, and "
"users adopt them at their own pace. When you are ready to go further, the "
"settings screen carries the login rate limit, the post-login prompt that "
"offers users a passkey, and reCAPTCHA for the password form. Making passkeys "
"mandatory for a role, disabling password login, cross-device QR sign-in and "
"recovery codes come with Rapls Passkey Pro."
msgstr ""
"既定ではパスキーはパスワードと併存します。何も取り上げず、ユーザーは自分の"
"ペースで移行できます。さらに進める準備ができたら、設定画面でログイン回数制"
"限、ログイン後のパスキー登録の案内、パスワードフォームの reCAPTCHA を設定でき"
